      "content": "idk. maybe. it just feels so heavy. like, if there's no real point to any of it, then why am i fighting so hard to keep everything upright? it feels like i'm just clinging to a sinking ship for no reason. sometimes i look at the patients and think... wouldn't it be kinder if they just, i don't know, found some peace? if the struggle just stopped?",
